    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόλων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flying jib,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.15.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spar which carries such a sail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>secret weapon, poniard, stiletto,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>fishing-rod</i> (?), <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.14
			</span></i>.</div>
